@startuml
actor User
boundary "Halaman Login (Blade)" as UI
control "JavaScript (Fetch API)" as JS
control "Auth Controller (Laravel)" as BE
database "Database (MySQL)" as DB

User -> UI : Masukkan Email & Password
User -> UI : Klik Tombol Login
activate UI

UI -> JS : handleLogin()
activate JS

JS -> BE : POST /api/login (credentials)
activate BE

BE -> DB : Cari User & Cek Password
activate DB
DB --> BE : Data User & Role Cocok
deactivate DB

BE -> BE : Generate Sanctum Token
BE --> JS : Return JSON (success, token, role)
deactivate BE

JS -> JS : Simpan Token ke LocalStorage
JS -> JS : Simpan Role ke LocalStorage

JS -> UI : Redirect ke Dashboard / Dapur
deactivate JS
UI --> User : Tampilan Dashboard Terbuka
deactivate UI
@enduml